**Goals** (per `TODO/pending/376_m2_r2_gpu_retrain_plan.md` + Wf-390-A1 plan_only):
1. **EMPIRICAL R² lift on real MetalCytoToxDB pIC50** for the 5-metal subset (Ru + Ir + Rh + Os + Re) — closes the long-standing `m2 R² gate PRESERVED HONEST_NEGATIVE_R2_DEEP` per Wf-388-A1 + Wf-377-A2 + Wf-369-A2 + Wf-398-A2.
